4,1,,status,Asuka,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":5,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
5,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,We should ensure we aren't just choosing a pretty picture. I'm interested in how previous city projects have actually held up over time.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Misaki,,I agree. We need to be realistic about the construction phase and whether the local firms can actually deliver what is promised.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Mio,,"I'm worried about the bills! It's easy to build something, but who pays for it in three years? We need to check the costs.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Asuka,,"The budget is one thing, but the people are another. I want to know who is actually available to maintain the site daily.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Minako,,We also can't ignore how people actually use the park and how the land handles the weather. Let's look at the data.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Benjamin,,"@Minako, that's a fair point. Logic suggests that usage patterns should dictate the design more than aesthetic preference.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Misaki,,"@Mio, if we look into the firms, we might find that some ""affordable"" plans are just under-quoted.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Mio,,Exactly! I want to see the actual spending ledgers for similar areas to see the real gap.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Asuka,,"I'll look into the staffing rolls. If we don't have the hands, the best plan will just wither.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Minako,,I'll focus on the drainage and the way people cross the site. We shouldn't fight the natural flow.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Benjamin,,I'll examine the earlier programme's condition. It's the best barometer for future quality.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Misaki,,I'll check the earth-moving tenders and the depot notes to see if the site can be phased properly.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Mio,,I'll look at the habitat fund terms and the upkeep ledger. I need to know where the money comes from.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Asuka,,I'll also check the volunteer groups. They might fill the gaps the city staff cannot.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Minako,,I'll add the heat readings to my list. August in this city is becoming a real problem for greenery.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
